# Build context for autotunex/Dockerfile, which builds from the REPOSITORY ROOT.
# BuildKit reads this file in place of the root .dockerignore (which serves the
# gbserver image and excludes autotunex/ altogether). It is an allowlist:
# everything is out unless re-included below, so nothing new at the TOP LEVEL can
# drift into the image. Inside the re-included trees, untracked files still enter
# the context — and granite.build's `"*"` package data ships them in the wheel —
# so the patterns at the end keep out the known junk. Anything else untracked
# there goes in.
*

# AutoTuneX itself.
!autotunex/pyproject.toml
!autotunex/README.md
!autotunex/src

# granite.build, for the gb-wheel stage of the llmb backend. .git carries the
# version tags setuptools_scm stamps the version from; it reaches the build only
# through the git-dir scratch stage, never a shipped layer.
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!.git
!src
!test
!configurations

# Never: caches, local env files, build outputs, logs, coverage data.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/dist
**/*.log
**/.coverage
**/.tox
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/.env*
**/.venv
autotunex/src/ux/build
autotunex/src/ux/.svelte-kit
src/gbserver/static/ui
